  message: "Fixed in PR #3587 (commit 24bd7c4b0f). Added `.csv.erb` to `_TEMPLATE_EXTENSIONS` and `_EXTENSION_LANGUAGE` (mapped to language `erb`) in `packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/linkers/view_template.py`. Two new tests cover probe-level discovery and chatwoot-shaped end-to-end edge emission.\n\nQuantitative claim awaiting bakeoff validation: 11 `Api::V2::Accounts::ReportsController` actions in chatwoot should now receive `renders` edges to their `.csv.erb` view files, raising the chatwoot `view-template-linker-v1` edge count by ~11. Tag stays until a DEEP cycle running chatwoot reproduces the count delta.\n\nOut of scope: other domain-specific Rails template extensions (`.xml.builder`, `.atom.builder`, `.js.erb`) — no UAT evidence they were missed; can be added if a future bakeoff surfaces a similar gap."  # 9702
